    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual and relaxing colony simulation inside the laboratory. Combine different mini-planets and civilizations, then put them into the time simulation device for 1000 years. It may not be long for us humans, but for these little creatures, it's eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776790/extras/f0313f4cd45f1f37de7e44551ab1c84e.poster.avif?t=1728926117\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776790/extras/f0313f4cd45f1f37de7e44551ab1c84e.gif?t=1728926117\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Events with multiple choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lot of combinations and ways to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the right balance between numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 different and unique missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sandbox mode is unlocked after completing the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden surprises to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, people keep whole mini-civilizations as pets, and they pay a lot of money for them. As an expert in your field, you travel through the galaxy and deliver the best colonies to customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Note from developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a really casual and relaxing game with occasional events that affect the evolution of a colony. There is no complex management. My idea was to keep it simple and funny at times. I hope it will relax you and make your day better.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual and relaxing colony simulation inside the laboratory. Combine different mini-planets and civilizations, then put them into the time simulation device for 1000 years. It may not be long for us humans, but for these little creatures, it's eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776790/extras/f0313f4cd45f1f37de7e44551ab1c84e.poster.avif?t=1728926117\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776790/extras/f0313f4cd45f1f37de7e44551ab1c84e.gif?t=1728926117\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Events with multiple choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lot of combinations and ways to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the right balance between numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 different and unique missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sandbox mode is unlocked after completing the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden surprises to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, people keep whole mini-civilizations as pets, and they pay a lot of money for them. As an expert in your field, you travel through the galaxy and deliver the best colonies to customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Note from developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a really casual and relaxing game with occasional events that affect the evolution of a colony. There is no complex management. My idea was to keep it simple and funny at times. I hope it will relax you and make your day better.</p>",
    "short_description": "Create mini planets and civilizations. Let them flourish, or let them fall - literally. The choice is yours, Doctor Planet.",
